=== Q8RWE8 GO:0008928 (finish_reason=length) ===
THINKING: The GO term is "mannose-1-phosphate guanylyltransferase (GDP) activity" with the definition that it catalyzes the reaction "alpha-D-mannose 1-phosphate + GDP + H+ = GDP-alpha-D-mannose + phosphate." This defines the primary chemical reaction of the enzyme, which is the transfer of a guanyl group from GDP to alpha-D-mannose 1-phosphate. 

The annotated features for protein Q8RWE8 include:
